# 1. SHORT

Esmeralda, the girl's mother, gave the basket of food to Maria, the girl in the red hood.

Esmeralda warned Maria, “Stay on the path.”

Maria met Grumple, the hungry wolf, in the dark woods.

Grumple asked Maria, “Where are you going?”

Maria answered Grumple, “To grandmother's cottage.”

Grumple swallowed Monique, the sick grandmother, at grandmother's cottage.

Grumple disguised himself as Monique in the bed.

In the afternoon at grandmother's cottage, Maria said, “What big eyes you have.”

Gary, the passing woodcutter, cut Grumple open, and Monique was alive.

Monique emerged alive.

